<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-19T17:37:21.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:37:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent incidents continue in the southern provinces, with a pipe bomb wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala and grenade attacks in Trang leading to arrests and seizure of bombs. A Chinese suspect was detained in Bangkok after attempting a 100,000 baht border crossing, and Malaysia appointed a new facilitator for southern Thailand peace talks. Cambodia and Thailand agreed on confidence-building measures at a UNCLOS meeting, and the WTO and multilateral partners reviewed progress on a supply chain finance initiative. Floods in Thailand killed 80 people as waters receded. The conflict recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-refugees-find-hope-in-thailand-s-work-program/a-79697921?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPQnRFOVctTzJ2dE1wVC1BMXN6MmtqRGN5eEZwTm1UaFhJSHd0dVZPU2F5a3RoRWFNay02d0NYa0NPVFFvNlZVdkVjMEVjR3phUkdrem9uc1BJWjlzek1fZUVobl8yUFFCZVNkOGJ4WXh6MUpJc29WeFdSWFZRZXRueFVJck51Yi15M01Nbzlsemw4TGlfekNIQjFZV19XUzZ1S2dYS2hyNlRHc0Z5?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQVjJvd3V4ZjRMZ1BpcnNnVkdFTWFaa1lZM054eDZaOVVKdEN3T1gwQUNoS3ZTQ1ZGODMwdUhveDVMRXhONy1GZHpWNUNWanFNTktZSFNCQzBzMllwQ25ERDBJOVlMZUo5bFUzMElEdG85LS1rT2hJdEIyUHNSd0l0WGVwYXcxMG54Q3FHcG9jNE1KSzNEWTZCb21GYmRGdkNsTDdpYnFWVkg4dU1DMWtv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNMk5tT2VXYXYtdkxZZldDb0xiTVdWQ2lMUzFkTDJyQmZ1UGxBc0lFSVRxNllHbDNHcGlISGVfODJVaFU3YTBKNHl0V3VCenp5UDUzVVVrX3JDLTFmN3lVNDJrZTFOYW55VVN1